==Bashkir==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|otk|ba}} ''bar'', from {{etyl|trk-pro|ba}} {{m|trk-pro|*bār||there is, there exist}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈbɑr]|lang=ba}}
* {{hyphenation|бар|lang=ba}}

===Predicative===
'''бар''' (bar)

# [[there is]] / [[there are]], [[there exist]]
#: {{usex|Ҡаҙағстанда ла аҙаш ауыл '''бар''' икән.|lang=ba|translation=As it happens, '''there is''' a village of the same nsame in Kazakhstan as well.}}

====Antonyms====
* [[юҡ]] {{qualifier|there is not}}

====Derived terms====
*{{l|ba|ысынбарлыҡ}}

